// A sibling module's STANDALONE `impl Trait for T {}` travels with its target type into the merged
// program: `run_store` takes a `dyn Store`, and passing a `NullStore` requires the standalone impl
// (in `Lib.noe`) to be visible for the coercion + the dynamic `label()` dispatch. Previously only an
// INLINE impl (on the class declaration) survived cross-module linking; a standalone one was dropped.
// expect: stdout "flushed"
// expect: exit 0

use App.Lib.{NullStore, run_store};

echo run_store(NullStore.new());
